factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script says Siddique Ali collected the Rs.30 lakh and embezzled it, but the article does not name the employee in that sentence; it is an inference but matches the article's structure, so this is not a problem. However, the slides_spec line 'வசூலான ரூ.30 லட்சம் நிறுவனக் கணக்கில் சேர்க்கப்படவில்லை' and 'ஊழியர் வசூலித்த பணத்தை நிறுவனத்துக்குச் செலுத்தவில்லை' are consistent with the article.
  The reel_script and slides_spec describe Manoj Shangla as the owner (உரிமையாளர்/நடத்துநர) of the company; the article only says he runs a computer parts sales company under that name, so 'உரிமையாளர்' is an acceptable reading but the phrase 'நிறுவன நடத்துநர்' is a slight paraphrase, not an invention.
  The reel_script states the incident happened 'கோவையில்' (in Coimbatore), while the article only gives the complainant's Coimbatore address; the location of the embezzlement itself is not stated, so this is an unsupported location claim.
  The slides_spec 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide and the reel_script omit the arrest/status detail, but the article gives no arrest, so no missing fact is involved; the article's key facts are otherwise covered.
